        <main>
            <section id="introduction" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Introduction<span class="text-cyan">.</span></h1>
                <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                    Pulse is the definitive community health intelligence layer for Web3. It provides protocols with real-time signals derived from on-chain telemetry.
                </p>
                <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 1.5rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-cyan);">
